  "body_text": "Parainema\nSarchimor\n|\nLempira\nCatimor\n他们来自于洪都拉斯3个不同的区域，是洪都拉斯独有的抗病品种\n具有不同程度的柑橘与茶感，甜感都很饱满\n微店传送\nLa Rinconada\n海拔：1670米\n区域: Comayagua （洪都拉斯西南部，内陆地区）\n农户：Luis Orlanda Torres Valle\n品种：Lempira & Parainema\nCorinto\n海拔：1300-1500米\n区域：位于Yoro的Subirana（洪都拉斯西北部，内陆地区）\n农户：Elio Santos\n品种：Parainema\nLuz Marina\n海拔：1600米\n区域：Jutiapa （洪都拉斯北部，相邻加勒比海）\n农户：Jorge Osorio\n品种：Parainema\n小知识\n现在主要流通着3个抗病谱系品种，分别是Catimor卡蒂姆，Sarchimor莎琪姆，Castillo卡斯蒂尤\nLempira = Timor Hybrid CIFC 832/1 x Caturra\nParainema = Timor Hybrid CIFC 832/2 x Villa Sarchi\nColombia (Castillo) =\nTimor Hybrid CIFC 1343 x Caturra Amarillo\nParainema - 顶端叶是绿色的，豆型修长，较大，有点像gesha\nLempira - 顶端叶是古铜色bronze，豆型偏圆胖，相较Parainema小一点，产量要优于Parainema\n资料源\nhttps://www.anacafe.org/glifos/index.php/Variedades_resistentes_a_roya\nhttps://varieties.worldcoffeeresearch.org/varieties/lempira\nhttps://varieties.worldcoffeeresearch.org/varieties/parainema\nhttps://varieties.worldcoffeeresearch.org/varieties/t8667\nhttps://varieties.worldcoffeeresearch.org/varieties/t5296",
  "body_html": "<div class=\"rich_media_content js_underline_content\" id=\"js_content\" style=\"visibility: hidden; opacity: 0; \">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<strong>\n           Parainema\n          </strong>\n<em>\n           Sarchimor\n          </em>\n          |\n          <strong>\n           Lempira\n          </strong>\n<em>\n           Catimor\n          </em>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          他们来自于洪都拉斯3个不同的区域，是洪都拉斯独有的抗病品种\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          具有不同程度的柑橘与茶感，甜感都很饱满\n          <a href=\"https://weidian.com/item.html?wfr=c&amp;itemID=2616834345&amp;ifr=itemdetail\" target=\"_blank\">\n           微店传送\n          </a>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/j67J43ibr4nibe2ia63RXFSMg4mnIhwXQA5exQPfjybPgAfBRjSlQE3jgAibSDCMOPicqu7DOqJAsWzpFaWwiaJmK1nw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           La Rinconada\n          </span>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          海拔：1670米\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          区域: Comayagua （洪都拉斯西南部，内陆地区）\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          农户：Luis Orlanda Torres Valle\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          品种：Lempira &amp; Parainema\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           Corinto\n          </span>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          海拔：1300-1500米\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          区域：位于Yoro的Subirana（洪都拉斯西北部，内陆地区）\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          农户：Elio Santos\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          品种：Parainema\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           Luz Marina\n          </span>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          海拔：1600米\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          区域：Jutiapa （洪都拉斯北部，相邻加勒比海）\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          农户：Jorge Osorio\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          品种：Parainema\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          小知识\n         </span>\n</p>\n<hr/>\n<p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<em>\n            现在主要流通着3个抗病谱系品种，分别是Catimor卡蒂姆，Sarchimor莎琪姆，Castillo卡斯蒂尤\n           </em>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/j67J43ibr4nibe2ia63RXFSMg4mnIhwXQA5Q6cTppPVn3RQWJU0UevXAaweYiaRGiaF3xqZOoUkfFUiciaCICHYvicjA2A/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<em>\n<br/>\n</em>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<em>\n<em>\n<em>\n<em>\n               Lempira = Timor Hybrid CIFC 832/1 x Caturra\n              </em>\n</em>\n</em>\n</em>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<em>\n<em>\n             Parainema = Timor Hybrid CIFC 832/2 x Villa Sarchi\n            </em>\n</em>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<em>\n            Colombia (Castillo) =\n           </em>\n<em>\n            Timor Hybrid CIFC 1343 x Caturra Amarillo\n           </em>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           Parainema - 顶端叶是绿色的，豆型修长，较大，有点像gesha\n          </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/j67J43ibr4nibe2ia63RXFSMg4mnIhwXQA5BkiaIned7NVF7lmoA7qauX8rDJurGBFNn0tp4uVG1nAdFxQMcVFZgrA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/j67J43ibr4nibe2ia63RXFSMg4mnIhwXQA5FTQrk8TEV9mtzr24I5qpnghJhEcnzIM5qnxq7Tf9jVvRHHjoxNjLsA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           Lempira - 顶端叶是古铜色bronze，豆型偏圆胖，相较Parainema小一点，产量要优于Parainema\n          </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/j67J43ibr4nibe2ia63RXFSMg4mnIhwXQA5R724PRFcLRPrDk265fsNUILO1CQ7RTCO8QTBeOUYdfpxCSYtYtz9iag/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<em>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/j67J43ibr4nibe2ia63RXFSMg4mnIhwXQA54Tibm2T8ZOKcrhiaK92icgn2Erp9mMJibcpTZ1G99EzeKLgTMK3wseK4BA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"width: 557px;height: 317px;\"/>\n</em>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           资料源\n          </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<a href=\"https://www.anacafe.org/glifos/index.php/Variedades_resistentes_a_roya\" style=\"font-size: 14px;text-decoration: underline;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            https://www.anacafe.org/glifos/index.php/Variedades_resistentes_a_roya\n           </span>\n</a>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<a href=\"https://varieties.worldcoffeeresearch.org/varieties/lempira\" style=\"font-size: 14px;text-decoration: underline;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            https://varieties.worldcoffeeresearch.org/varieties/lempira\n           </span>\n</a>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<a href=\"https://varieties.worldcoffeeresearch.org/varieties/parainema\" style=\"font-size: 14px;text-decoration: underline;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            https://varieties.worldcoffeeresearch.org/varieties/parainema\n           </span>\n</a>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<a href=\"https://varieties.worldcoffeeresearch.org/varieties/t8667\" style=\"font-size: 14px;text-decoration: underline;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            https://varieties.worldcoffeeresearch.org/varieties/t8667\n           </span>\n</a>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<a href=\"https://varieties.worldcoffeeresearch.org/varieties/t5296\" style=\"font-size: 14px;text-decoration: underline;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            https://varieties.worldcoffeeresearch.org/varieties/t5296\n           </span>\n</a>\n</p>\n<p>\n</p>\n</p>\n</div>",
